Conclusion--
-- Today I learned that spatial anchors allow virtual objects to remain fixed at specific locations in the real world, even when the user moves away or returns later.
I also learned that persistent AR uses these anchors to create long-lasting mixed reality experiences where digital content stays connected to the physical environment. 
These technologies make XR applications more practical for productivity, education, navigation, and collaboration.
